Subject: Use portable C paths instead of inline assembly under Fil-C
Policy-Class: P2-Package
Rationale: Take Zend's portable C paths for zend_string_equal_val, zend_safe_address, signed multiply, and overflow arithmetic (avoiding asm goto callbr), guard x87 inline asm to __i386__, and spell xgetbv directly instead of raw .byte opcodes under __FILC__.
Upstream-Status: Upstream-Candidate
